license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A source-audited reanalysis of recorded LinkedIn application counts from
  Kaggle version 13, with training-only feature construction, shared-fold
  evaluation, exposure sensitivity analyses, and explicit measurement limits.
keywords:
  - job postings
  - reproducible analysis
  - Poisson regression
  - data quality
